  "id": "USN-9048-1",
  "summary": "awl vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Andrew Bartlett discovered that AWL did not properly generate session\nkeys. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to guess a session\nkey and impersonate another user's session. (CVE-2020-11728)\n\nIt was discovered that AWL did not securely generate long-term session\ncookies. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to guess a\nsession cookie through a brute-force attack and gain access to another\nuser's session. (CVE-2020-11729)",
